SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This CC BY 4.0 license applies to the deposited dataset (master_dataset.csv) and
the original documentation, metadata and helper scripts authored for this
release.

It does NOT relicense third-party material. Bibliographic information and
extracted factual data originate from the cited primary scientific publications,
which remain subject to the rights of their respective publishers and authors.
Source-publication PDFs are NOT included in this deposit. See NOTICE.md.

