HOW TO ATTRIBUTE THIS DATASET

Elfetni, Seifallah (2026). "Unified, curated dataset of biomass hydrothermal
treatment/liquefaction experiments for lignocellulosic and lignin-rich biomass",
Version 1. RADAR. [DOI to be inserted once assigned by RADAR.]

Please also cite the relevant primary publications listed in the dataset's
paper_title / DOI fields.
